{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026E86s17LGfc1795168969.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>德國桌球大師賽，「白旋風」韋德躋身正賽。</p><p></p><p>64歲的韋德，外圍賽連續三圈，都要打足9局，面對中國的龐俊旭，韋德最高打出一桿99度，大分一度拉開3-1。對手追至4平手，韋德決勝局頂著壓力，再贏72-8，將粉紅球打入尾袋，奠定勝局，贏局數5-4，韋德連過三關入正賽。</p><p></p><p>另一場，利素斯基對艾朗希爾，領先局數3-2後，打出一桿147滿分，去年在北愛公開賽封王的他，相隔14年再打出147，是生涯第二次，他以局數5-3入正賽。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.143454+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T09:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T11:57:12.419582+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:19.842574+00:00","content_hash":"57543fbc0b8a61da3901f15ee8a82ae65a91d2e351031c86358717088d06aa2e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.143454+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}